      <h1 id="cpmso-manually-scaling-control-planes" class="group scroll-mt-20">Manually scaling control plane machines<a href="#cpmso-manually-scaling-control-planes" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>Manually scale to 4 or 5 control plane nodes on bare-metal infrastructure to recover from a degraded state, perform deep-level debugging, or ensure control plane stability in complex scenarios.</p>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Important</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>Red Hat supports a cluster that has 4 or 5 control plane nodes only on bare-metal infrastructure.</p>
